  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1: complete content-aware pipeline (replaces 1.3.0 which was missing the new services). CavemanContentRouter detects content type (JSON array, code, log, diff, HTML, tabular, plain text) and routes to the best compressor. CavemanJsonCrusher compresses JSON arrays via lossless CSV/markdown-table or lossy BM25 row-drop with CCR reversibility markers. CavemanCacheAligner detects volatile tokens (UUIDs, ISO-8601, JWTs, hex hashes) that break LLM KV-cache prefix reuse. CavemanCcrStore caches dropped rows for on-demand retrieval. CavemanCompressionCache: two-tier cache (skip + result) with configurable TTL. CavemanContentDetector, CavemanLogCompressor, CavemanSearchCompressor, CavemanDiffCompressor, CavemanHtmlExtractor, CavemanCodeCompressor, CavemanTabularCompressor, CavemanWasteAnalyzer included. ICompressionService gains CompressContentAsync() with backward-compatible default. CavemanContentRouterBuilder for fluent DI. CompressionProfile enum (Light/Balanced/Agent/Aggressive). All additive; existing API unchanged.",
